WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:05.050
Getting funded with Lamp. Part three: your offers.

2
00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:09.470
When funders make offers, they show up here, side by side.

3
00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:13.530
The big number is the amount the funder advances.

4
00:00:14.130 --> 00:00:18.220
Lands in your account is what you actually receive, after fees.

5
00:00:18.730 --> 00:00:24.700
Each payment is how much comes out each time, daily or weekly. Payments is how many.

6
00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:30.530
Total cost is what the funding costs you, all in. Compare it across offers.

7
00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:35.230
Pick the one that fits, and press Accept this offer.

8
00:00:38.490 --> 00:00:44.360
Nothing is final until you sign the funder's agreement. Your rep sends it to you to review first.

9
00:00:44.870 --> 00:00:49.180
Then the funder does its final checks, and the money lands in your account.

10
00:00:49.650 --> 00:00:54.980
Questions? Text or call your rep, or email hello@getlamp.app.
